24:["$","section","3-NUST: do not miss the admission-stage aid form",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"NUST: do not miss the admission-stage aid form"}],[["$","p","NUST’s need-based procedure uses the NFAAF. The initial form deadline follows the admission application instructions. An emergency request during an academic cycle is a different process, not a substitute for an omitted initial form.",{"children":"NUST’s need-based procedure uses the NFAAF. The initial form deadline follows the admission application instructions. An emergency request during an academic cycle is a different process, not a substitute for an omitted initial form."}],["$","p","Check the appropriate applicant or enrolled-student route, required household evidence and university communication. Keep a record of any awarded grant, fee adjustment or other product so that repayment and continuation conditions are clear.",{"children":"Check the appropriate applicant or enrolled-student route, required household evidence and university communication. Keep a record of any awarded grant, fee adjustment or other product so that repayment and continuation conditions are clear."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://nust.edu.pk/admissions/scholarships/need-based-financial-aid/",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://nust.edu.pk/admissions/scholarships/need-based-financial-aid/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"NUST need-based aid"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
25:["$","section","4-Women, subjects and provincial schemes",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Women, subjects and provincial schemes"}],[["$","p","The Scotland Pakistan 2026 page describes a women-focused route with eligible bachelor’s/master’s subjects and an admission requirement. Its extended 15 September 2026 deadline is past as of this review. A remaining application button does not establish a new open cycle.",{"children":"The Scotland Pakistan 2026 page describes a women-focused route with eligible bachelor’s/master’s subjects and an admission requirement. Its extended 15 September 2026 deadline is past as of this review. A remaining application button does not establish a new open cycle."}],["$","p","Provincial funds can restrict domicile, institution, study level, quota or marks. Check the actual fund’s current official call. We have not filled a PEEF row with old policy numbers because the current conditions were not established in this review. Do not treat similarly named funds or unofficial application sellers as interchangeable.",{"children":"Provincial funds can restrict domicile, institution, study level, quota or marks. Check the actual fund’s current official call. We have not filled a PEEF row with old policy numbers because the current conditions were not established in this review. Do not treat similarly named funds or unofficial application sellers as interchangeable."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.britishcouncil.pk/scotland-pakistan-scholarships-young-women-and-girls",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.britishcouncil.pk/scotland-pakistan-scholarships-young-women-and-girls","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Scotland Pakistan 2026 dedicated page"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
26:["$","section","5-Build a useful financial-evidence folder",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a useful financial-evidence folder"}],[["$","p","The fund decides the final checklist. Commonly requested information can include household members, income sources, employment or pension evidence, relevant assets, educational expenses and admission/enrolment details. Prepare an inventory first rather than collecting sensitive papers for an unverified offer.",{"children":"The fund decides the final checklist. Commonly requested information can include household members, income sources, employment or pension evidence, relevant assets, educational expenses and admission/enrolment details. Prepare an inventory first rather than collecting sensitive papers for an unverified offer."}],["$","p","Use consistent names, dates and household explanations. When an income source is irregular or evidence is unavailable, ask the aid office how to document the actual situation. Do not invent an income certificate or hide another award.",{"children":"Use consistent names, dates and household explanations. When an income source is irregular or evidence is unavailable, ask the aid office how to document the actual situation. Do not invent an income certificate or hide another award."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L29",null,{"id":"guides/scholarships-in-pakistan:section-6","title":"Check your progress","items":["Current official form and campus deadline.","Admission/enrolment and student reference.","Requested household and financial evidence.","Domicile/subject/level restrictions checked.","Submission receipt and contact details saved."]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
27:["$","section","6-A scholarship does not always cover every expense",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A scholarship does not always cover every expense"}],[["$","p","List tuition, mandatory charges, hostel/rent, meals, transport, books and any recurring equipment costs. Mark whether an award pays the university, reimburses later or provides a stipend. An approved amount and the timing of the first payment answer different budget questions.",{"children":"List tuition, mandatory charges, hostel/rent, meals, transport, books and any recurring equipment costs. Mark whether an award pays the university, reimburses later or provides a stipend. An approved amount and the timing of the first payment answer different budget questions."}],["$","p","Original example: if an institution confirms a tuition reduction but the student still owes hostel and transport charges, those costs remain in the funding gap. A loan may help with timing but carries repayment obligations. Keep loan support separate from a non-repayable award.",{"children":"Original example: if an institution confirms a tuition reduction but the student still owes hostel and transport charges, those costs remain in the funding gap. A loan may help with timing but carries repayment obligations. Keep loan support separate from a non-repayable award."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
28:["$","section","7-Ask the aid office a precise question",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Ask the aid office a precise question"}],[["$","p","A short enquiry is more useful when it includes your programme, campus, admission category and study year. Ask whether the named scheme is currently accepting applications, what form to use and what deadline controls your case.",{"children":"A short enquiry is more useful when it includes your programme, campus, admission category and study year. Ask whether the named scheme is currently accepting applications, what form to use and what deadline controls your case."}]],"$undefined","$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"sample-card","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"sample-card__label","children":"Teaching example"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Adaptable financial-aid enquiry"}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"I am an applicant/enrolled student in [programme, campus and year]. Does [scheme] accept applications for my category in the current cycle? Please share the official form, deadline, financial-evidence checklist and whether the support is a grant, fee reduction or repayable loan."}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"sample-card__note","children":"Use the published institutional contact. Do not send private financial records to an unverified address."}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Ask the aid office a precise question","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/scholarship-application/",{"href":"/guides/scholarship-application/","children":["Scholarship application checklist",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/undergraduate-scholarships-for-pakistani-students/",{"href":"/guides/undergraduate-scholarships-for-pakistani-students/","children":["Undergraduate study abroad funding",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/masters-scholarships-for-pakistani-students/",{"href":"/guides/masters-scholarships-for-pakistani-students/","children":["Master’s study abroad funding",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/mba-scholarships-for-pakistani-students/",{"href":"/guides/mba-scholarships-for-pakistani-students/","children":["MBA funding and loans",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
